### 演出录音播放版税结算服务 API 示例
### 在 VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP Client 中可直接执行。
@host = http://localhost:8000
@api = {{host}}/api/v1

### 健康检查
GET {{host}}/health

### 登记权利人
POST {{api}}/rightsholders
Content-Type: application/json

{"code":"RH-001","name":"作曲家甲"}

###
POST {{api}}/rightsholders
Content-Type: application/json

{"code":"RH-002","name":"作词家乙"}

###
POST {{api}}/rightsholders
Content-Type: application/json

{"code":"RH-003","name":"出版商丙"}

### 登记作品
POST {{api}}/works
Content-Type: application/json

{"code":"W-001","title":"夜场录音 A"}

###
POST {{api}}/works
Content-Type: application/json

{"code":"W-002","title":"夜场录音 B"}

### 创建协议（区间 [from, to)，比例合计必须为 100）
POST {{api}}/agreements
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "work_code": "W-001",
  "valid_from": "2026-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "valid_to": "2026-07-01T00:00:00Z",
  "shares": [
    {"rightsholder_code": "RH-001", "ratio": "50"},
    {"rightsholder_code": "RH-002", "ratio": "30"},
    {"rightsholder_code": "RH-003", "ratio": "20"}
  ]
}

### 查询协议（可按作品过滤）
GET {{api}}/agreements?work_code=W-001

### 导入播放记录（金额为非负整数，最小货币单位）
POST {{api}}/plays
Content-Type: application/json

{"code":"P-0001","work_code":"W-001","occurred_at":"2026-02-10T20:00:00Z","amount":100}

### 幂等：同编号同内容 -> 200
POST {{api}}/plays
Content-Type: application/json

{"code":"P-0001","work_code":"W-001","occurred_at":"2026-02-10T20:00:00Z","amount":100}

### 异内容：同编号不同金额 -> 422 play_code_content_mismatch
POST {{api}}/plays
Content-Type: application/json

{"code":"P-0001","work_code":"W-001","occurred_at":"2026-02-10T20:00:00Z","amount":199}

### 更正：引用原编号，使用新编号
POST {{api}}/plays
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "P-0001-V2",
  "work_code": "W-001",
  "occurred_at": "2026-02-10T20:00:00Z",
  "amount": 90,
  "corrects_code": "P-0001"
}

### 分叉更正：再更正已被更正的原记录 -> 422 correction_fork
POST {{api}}/plays
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "P-0001-ALT",
  "work_code": "W-001",
  "occurred_at": "2026-02-10T20:00:00Z",
  "amount": 80,
  "corrects_code": "P-0001"
}

### 查看更正链（根 -> 链尾）
GET {{api}}/plays/P-0001/chain

### 仅链尾记录（默认）；加 include_superseded=true 可看留痕全量
GET {{api}}/plays

### 批量导入（逐条返回 created/idempotent/rejected）
POST {{api}}/plays/batch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "plays": [
    {"code":"P-0002","work_code":"W-001","occurred_at":"2026-02-11T20:00:00Z","amount":101},
    {"code":"P-0003","work_code":"W-002","occurred_at":"2026-02-12T20:00:00Z","amount":250},
    {"code":"P-0002","work_code":"W-001","occurred_at":"2026-02-11T20:00:00Z","amount":101}
  ]
}

### 试算期间应付与待处理（period 为 [from, to)），detail=true 返回逐笔分账
GET {{api}}/settlement/compute?period_from=2026-01-01T00:00:00Z&period_to=2026-04-01T00:00:00Z&detail=true

### 出具初始单据
POST {{api}}/settlement/statements
Content-Type: application/json

{"period_from":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","period_to":"2026-04-01T00:00:00Z"}

### 无变化重复出具 -> 409 no_change
POST {{api}}/settlement/statements
Content-Type: application/json

{"period_from":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","period_to":"2026-04-01T00:00:00Z"}

### 后补 W-002 协议（可追溯到 1 月）
POST {{api}}/agreements
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "work_code": "W-002",
  "valid_from": "2026-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "valid_to": "2027-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "shares": [
    {"rightsholder_code": "RH-001", "ratio": "40"},
    {"rightsholder_code": "RH-002", "ratio": "60"}
  ]
}

### 再次出具同一期间 -> 生成可正可负的追补单（kind=adjustment，金额为差额）
POST {{api}}/settlement/statements
Content-Type: application/json

{"period_from":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","period_to":"2026-04-01T00:00:00Z"}

### 单据列表
GET {{api}}/settlement/statements

### 单据详情
@sid = 1
GET {{api}}/settlement/statements/{{sid}}
